{
  "_note": [
    "Transcribed from player_aid/LoH_Grognard_Sheet.pdf ('The Grognard Sheet').",
    "Each column of that sheet gives, per Rank, its income (M) and its N/G/E",
    "promotion requirements, e.g. 'M14/N40/G155/E130' for Colonel.",
    "",
    "Income is a clean arithmetic progression (2 per rank step), continuing",
    "upward to Marechal (22) even though Marechal has no printed N/G/E",
    "requirement on the sheet - it is reached only via the 'Creation of the",
    "Marshalate' event (Card 31 per the Rules Summary Sheet), not by meeting",
    "stat thresholds, hence requirements 0/0/0. The app's canBePromoted()",
    "selector already gates Marechal behind state.grandReviewAtBoulogneDone",
    "for this reason.",
    "",
    "Intermediate ranks between Sous-Lieutenant and Major (order values 10 and",
    "50) leave room (20,30,40) in case a finer ladder is discovered later;",
    "none is currently known from the player aids."
